    "Html": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We can address human health and climate crises at the same time by increasing consumption of plant-based foods, including animal-free meat substitutes, and substantially reducing our intake of meat, eggs, and dairy.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">What does the latest research on plant-based meat alternatives say? This fact sheet is a summary of the main takeaways.</span></p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-113164\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/02/plant-based-meat-alternatives-infographic-01.jpg\" alt=\"Plant based meat alternatives fact sheet\" width=\"770\" height=\"996\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/02/plant-based-meat-alternatives-infographic-01.jpg 770w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/02/plant-based-meat-alternatives-infographic-01-768x993.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/02/plant-based-meat-alternatives-infographic-01-720x931.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/02/plant-based-meat-alternatives-infographic-01-540x698.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 770px) 100vw, 770px\"/></p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-113167\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/02/plant-based-meat-alternatives-infographic-02.jpg\" alt=\"Plant based meat alternatives fact sheet\" width=\"768\" height=\"914\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/02/plant-based-meat-alternatives-infographic-02.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/02/plant-based-meat-alternatives-infographic-02-720x857.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2023/02/plant-based-meat-alternatives-infographic-02-540x643.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"/></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Get this fact sheet as a downloadable PDF </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.box.com/s/mju0o48ofqm1snag2ibiqiszri4v8wl2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">here</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For more details about these studies, watch the free videos on the NutritionFacts.org’s </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/NutritionFactsOrg\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">YouTube channel</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> or on the website’s </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/topics/meat-substitutes/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Meat Substitutes topic page</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>"
